cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Somnoscribe Sleep Study Review Assistant
message: >-
  If you refer to this software in academic or clinical work, please cite it
  using these metadata, and state that output was adjudicated by a human
  reviewer.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Macra
    given-names: Alex
repository-code: https://github.com/alex-macra/somnoscribe
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 0.2.0-alpha.1
date-released: '2026-08-05'
keywords:
  - sleep medicine
  - polysomnography
  - home sleep apnea testing
  - EDF
  - clinical decision support
  - self-hosted
abstract: >-
  Somnoscribe is an experimental, self-hosted review workspace for sleep-study
  artifacts. It preprocesses EDF recordings and supporting documents, drafts
  evidence-linked observations with a large language model, and requires a
  human reviewer to adjudicate every drafted claim before sign-off. It is
  clinician-assist research software, not an autonomous diagnostic system and
  not a medical device.
